---
description: Frontend JSX standards for Amakuru admin and widget
globs: frontend/**/*.{js,jsx}
---

# Frontend standards (JSX)

- Dashboard and widget use plain JavaScript/JSX. Do not add TypeScript (`.ts`/`.tsx`) under `frontend/`
- User-visible strings come from message catalogues, never hard-coded
- Prefer TanStack Query for server state in the dashboard
- Generate the API client from OpenAPI in `packages/api-client`; do not hand-write the client contract
- Use React Router for dashboard navigation; keep the widget as a Preact Shadow DOM bundle
